{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"28debcceda78027cd4832110e72c07efc99641b01179ea4cec2c72fa22f6ea55"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:0a6a2a31669d3d502b7947dcb35e4d4c9fd3cc5d50c92188a460eca61ee728e5","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"She is in a committed relationship","evidence":"[D2:5 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Deborah: My husband and I are trying to be as good a family as my parents were!\n[D19:11 | 12:52 am on 19 August, 2023] Deborah: Reminds me of when I used to play games with my husband. We'd take turns and it was a great way to bond and make memories. Gaming really can bring people closer, right?\n[D23:4 | 11:46 am on 30 August, 2023] Deborah: Yep, last month I visited my mom`s house which holds a special place in my heart. My mom had good and bad times there, but it's still a symbol of her strength and the love she shared with me. This is my husband in front of this house.\n[D28:11 | 3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023] Deborah: That beach is super special to me. It's where I got married and discovered my love for surfing. It's always filled with joy and peace.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9a8c8a48-abc7-50fb-80d5-9c7b46301c56","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ebb545b77a9d81b788a94af98acbe1dc1ab6b46c7a8dbaf4d7d00a354c751349","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Is Deborah married?","referenceAnswer":"yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb545b77a9d81b788a94af98acbe1dc1ab6b46c7a8dbaf4d7d00a354c751349"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}